{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FDDX2S8iHJ1795422919.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區主要股市走勢波動，韓國股市曾見十個月低位。</p><p></p><p>韓國政府上日表示推出穩定股市措施，韓股周一仍低開，並一度急瀉百分之5.8，落到4,589點。韓國交易所曾經暫停程式化賣盤交易。韓股收市跌幅收窄至百分之3.3，險守4,700點水平。</p><p></p><p>台灣金管會亦宣布採取救市措施，台股周一先跌後回升。早段跌至35,400點邊緣後有支持，一度倒升近百分之3，高位見37,108點。終止過去兩日跌勢。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市則連跌第八日，收市跌幅不足百分之1。</p><p></p><p>日本股市則假期休市。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:43:56.996398+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:07:17.726194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T10:37:23.299031+00:00","content_hash":"9949f2456d46928ba8ed524f482370a357f745384fc88d73a7fa4d25ab2dc206","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:43:56.996398+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}